OL,3,GNEWSATown's campaign to save Grade II  
OL,4,Alisted building                        
OL,6,FA campaign group is trying to save a   
OL,7,FGrade II* listed building from falling 
OL,8,Finto disrepair.                        
OL,10,FThe Manor House in Cleobury Mortimer   
OL,11,Fhad been a nursing home since 1988, but
OL,12,Fwas shut down by the owner due to      
OL,13,F"financial viability" pressures.       
OL,15,FThe group Save The Manor House said it 
OL,16,Fhad tried to get the building's owner  
OL,17,Fto "restore it or sell up" for three   
OL,18,Fyears in the hope of turning it into   
OL,19,Fsomething that benefitted the town and 
OL,20,Fprovided employment.                   
