OL,3,GNEWSATown's campaign to save Grade II  
OL,4,Alisted building                        
OL,6,FOwner Zahid Iqbal told the BBC he had  
OL,7,Fstarted restoring the building, and had
OL,8,F"tradesman working on the property".   
